            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Shellporter 0.1.3</h2>
<ul>
<li>Open Ghostty new-window launches through Ghostty 1.3+ AppleScript support so new windows stay in the existing app instance without an extra Dock icon</li>
<li>Keep a compatibility fallback for older Ghostty versions or disabled AppleScript support</li>
</ul>
